{"kind":"report","text":"Revised the fan-out decision under existing promise 82b098b7 after ratifying canonical changes-requested review 30c47f5b through act dceff334. Retired the rejected proposal and its old completion report through 7526fe89 and 85047f1b. An intermediate refile was ordinarily stale because it structurally rested on the review of the retired proposal; I retired that proposal and its two child requests through 3922a860, d30257a5 and ac890038 and re-anchored cleanly on the current promise.\n\nCurrent ratifiable proposal 85f9060f keeps incremental fan-out as the governed dimension and uses performance/contract-v1.json unchanged: full-tier submit_ack fan-out axis at the contract-selected depth 1,000, widths 1, 8, 16, 64 and 256, five warmups and 100 repetitions per separate case distribution. The signed statistic is median(T_f)/median(T_1)-1, with no clamp and no invented pairing. PREVIEW requires every width through 64 to add at most ten percent; FIRST-PRODUCTION requires every width through 256 to add at most ten percent. Ten percent is a product allowance, not a ceiling fitted to the 0.22 ms observation or measurement noise. The proposal makes no absolute-difference load-cancellation claim, treats changing load regimes as a validity threat, describes completed-sample digest equality as a harness precondition rather than discriminating proof, and confines the verdict to the independent contract fan-out axis rather than implying a depth-50,000 or depth-500,000 cross-product result.\n\nClean child request d04a4dee assigns Claude the contract-full retained evidence and documentation update after proposal review/adoption and the current scale head settles. It requires the page to replace the old Max-fan-out record 50 ms row with the relative fan-out dimension and add a separate fixed one-base append 50 ms row that stays an honest miss. Clean independent review request fef06b40 asks Claude to check the exact revised proposal before adoption.\n\nFixed-cost request 8add6909 was not unparked. Planner has reported its parked coordination via 3bb86abd, but that stale report remains unratified and no implementation authority was released. No source, tracked documentation, branch, active Claude scale head, Git ref or merge was changed by this correction. Remaining external steps are Claude review of fef06b40 and authorized ratifier adoption of 85f9060f; the evidence/docs loop d04a4dee is deliberately gated on both."}